== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From {{term|talar||you speak|lang=is}} the second person singular form of {{term|tala||to speak|lang=is}} + {{term|þú||you|lang=is}} + the [[singular]] [[indefinite article]] [[accusative]] form of the language in question.

=== Phrase ===
'''[[tala#Icelandic|talar]] [[þú#Icelandic|þú]]'''...?

# (with accusative) do [[you]] [[speak]]...?

